Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.65,0:01:23.59,OC,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,12)\fad(400,500)\be1\1c&H0010431E\3c&H0042BC70}無論何處都能到達
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.62,0:01:30.02,OC,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,12)\fad(200,200)\be1\1c&H00607BAE\3c&H007EB7D6}在那牽繫在一起的雙手間
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.12,0:01:36.66,OC,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,12)\fad(200,200)\be1\1c&H00AB969E\3c&H00C9C1C1}若能尋覓到那小小的未來
